# No API keys are needed to build or run this app.
#
# AI beat generation uses a bring-your-own-key model: each visitor enters their
# own Anthropic API key in the app, it is stored in their browser, and requests
# go directly from their browser to Anthropic. No key is ever baked into the
# build or held by the server.
#
# The old VITE_GEMINI_API_KEY has been removed. Anything prefixed VITE_ is
# inlined into the public JavaScript bundle at build time, so it was readable by
# anyone who opened devtools — never put a secret behind that prefix.
